# FunctionCallable

|**Interface info**|
|:-------------------------------------------------------------------|
|public interface FunctionCallable 设置需要调用的云函数后，可以通过此类的方法调用云函数或设置超时时间。|

## Public Method Summary

|Qualifier and Type|Method|
|:--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|:--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|HarmonyTask <[FunctionResult](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/AppGallery-connect-References/functionresult-java-0000001199044523)>|[call](#section1778610342376)() 调用没有入参的函数。|
|<T> HarmonyTask <[FunctionResult](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/AppGallery-connect-References/functionresult-java-0000001199044523)>|[call](#section2747122193819)(T object) 调用有入参的函数。|
|long|[getTimeout](#section191835518383)() 获取函数的超时时间。|
|void|[setTimeout](#section1180921184819)(long timeout, TimeUnit units) 设置函数的超时时间。|
|[FunctionCallable](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/AppGallery-connect-References/functioncallable-java-0000001153164826)|[clone](#section48731215103916)(long timeout, TimeUnit units) 创建FunctionCallable实例，使用指定的超时时间。|

## Public Methods

### call

|Method|
|:---------------------------------------------------|
|public HarmonyTask<FunctionResult> call() 调用没有入参的函数。|

**Return**

|Type|Description|
|:----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|:--------------|
|HarmonyTask <[FunctionResult](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/AppGallery-connect-References/functionresult-java-0000001199044523)>|以异步方式返回函数执行的结果。|

### call(T object)

|Method|
|:-------------------------------------------------------------|
|public <T>HarmonyTask<FunctionResult> call(T object) 调用有入参的函数。|

**Parameters**

|Name|Parameter Description|
|:-----|:-------------------------------------------------|
|object|包含函数入参值的自定义对象，可以是任意对象类型。对象中包含的入参值需要与创建云函数时设置的入参对应。|

**Return**

|Type|Description|
|:--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|:---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|<T> HarmonyTask <[FunctionResult](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/AppGallery-connect-References/functionresult-java-0000001199044523)>|以异步方式返回函数执行的结果。您可以在接口返回的Task中设置一个addOnCompleteListener回调监听，在回调方法中获取包含函数执行结果的[FunctionResult](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/AppGallery-connect-References/functionresult-java-0000001199044523)对象。|

### getTimeout

|Method|
|:------------------------------------|
|public long getTimeout() 获取函数执行的超时时间。|

**Return**

|Type|Description|
|:---|:---------------------|
|long|返回函数执行超时时长，单位由开发者自行定义。|

### setTimeout

|Method|
|:----------------------------------------------------------------|
|public void setTimeout(long timeout, TimeUnit units) 设置函数执行的超时时间。|

**Parameters**

|Name|Description|
|:------|:------------------------|
|timeout|需要设置的函数超时时长，单位由units参数定义。|
|units|定义时间单位的TimeUnit对象。|

### clone

|Method|
|:--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|public FunctionCallable clone(long timeout, TimeUnit units) 创建一个FunctionCallable实例，使用指定的超时时间。|

**Parameters**

|Name|Description|
|:------|:--------------------------|
|timeout|需要设置的函数超时时间时长，单位由units参数定义。|
|units|定义时间单位的TimeUnit对象。|

**Return**

|Type|Description|
|:------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|:------------------------|
|[FunctionCallable](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/AppGallery-connect-References/functioncallable-java-0000001153164826)|返回新创建的FunctionCallable对象。|

